  "content": {
   "rendered": "\n<div class=\"wp-block-media-text alignwide is-stacked-on-mobile is-vertically-aligned-top coblocks-animate\" style=\"grid-template-columns:28% auto\" data-coblocks-animation=\"slideInLeft\"><figure class=\"wp-block-media-text__media\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"683\" height=\"1024\" src=\"https://buguitr.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/14f2db82_original-683x1024.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1602 size-full\" srcset=\"https://buguitr.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/14f2db82_original-683x1024.jpg 683w, https://buguitr.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/14f2db82_original-200x300.jpg 200w, https://buguitr.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/14f2db82_original-768x1152.jpg 768w, https://buguitr.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/14f2db82_original-40x60.jpg 40w, https://buguitr.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/14f2db82_original.jpg 960w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 683px) 100vw, 683px\" /></figure><div class=\"wp-block-media-text__content\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\"><div class=\"wp-block-group__inner-container is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-medium-font-size\"><div class=\"wp-block-group__inner-container is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote is-layout-flow wp-block-quote-is-layout-flow\">\n<p class=\"has-small-font-size wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>DİĞER ADLARI:</strong> Shiguang Daili Ren, <a href=\"https://myanimelist.net/anime/44074/Shiguang_Dailiren\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">时光代理人</a></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-small-font-size wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>ÜLKE | DİL:</strong>&nbsp;ÇİN | ÇİNCE</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-small-font-size wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>BÖLÜM SAYISI:</strong>&nbsp;12</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-small-font-size wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>ÇIKIŞ TARİHİ:</strong>&nbsp;30 Nisan 2021</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-small-font-size wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>TÜR:</strong>&nbsp;Gizem, Dram, Doğaüstü</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-small-font-size wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>ÇEVİRMEN:</strong> Pebbles</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-small-font-size wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>VIDEO EDİTÖR:</strong> Maedhros</p>\n</blockquote>\n</div></div>\n</div></div>\n</div></div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-drop-cap wp-block-paragraph\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-purple-color\">Modern bir metropolde “Shiguang Fotoğraf Stüdyosu” adında küçük bir dükkân vardır. </mark></strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-purple-color\">Sadece birkaç müşteri ziyarete gelse de aslında özel güçlere sahip iki adam olan Cheng Xiaoshi ve Lu Guang tarafından yönetiliyordur. </mark></strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-purple-color\">İş birliği yapıp müşterinin isteğini yerine getirmek adına fotoğraflara girmek için süper güçlerini kullanırlar.</mark></strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-purple-color\"> Ancak işler planlandıkları gibi gitmez.</mark></strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-vivid-purple-color has-text-color wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>※ BÖLÜMLER ※</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center is-style-default has-pale-pink-color has-blush-light-purple-gradient-background has-text-color has-background has-small-font-size has-custom-lineheight has-custom-letterspacing wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"line-height:2.15;letter-spacing:1.5px;font-size:100px\">BİRİNCİ SEZON</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table is-style-stripes\"><table class=\"has-vivid-purple-color has-text-color has-background\" style=\"background-color:#9b51e05e\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\"><a href=\"